1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 Nc6 6. Be3 e5 7. Nf3 h6 
8. Bc4 Be7 9. O-O O-O 10. Qe2 a6 11. Nd5 $5 {Adams brings a nice novelty. 
He takes  the initiative.} 
    ( 11. a4 {Known is} )
11. ... Nxd5 
    ( 11. ... Nxe4 $4 {Not} 12. Bb6 )
12. Bxd5 Bg4 13. h3 Bh5 14. Rfd1 Qc7 15. c3 $5 Rac8 16. a4 Bd8 17. g4 $5 
Bg6 18. Nd2 Ne7 19. Bb3 Qc6 $1 20. a5 d5 $1 21. Nf3 Bc7 $6 {Kozul  
sacrifices  a pawn for a blockade.} 
    ( 21. ... Bxe4 $1 22. Nxe5 Qe6 23. Bd4 {(Kozul)} 23. ... Qd6 24. f3 
    Bh7 {brings less advantage for White.} )
22. exd5 Qd6 23. Nd2 e4 24. Nf1 f5 25. c4 Qb4 $2 
    ( 25. ... Bf7 {Better is} )
26. Qc2 $1 f4 27. Ra4 $1 Qd6 28. c5 $1 Qf6 29. d6+ Kh7 30. Qc3 $2 {Adams 
misses a fat chance.} 
    ( 30. Bxf4 $1 Qxf4 31. dxe7 Rfe8 32. Be6 Rb8 33. Rd7 {wins for White.}
    )
30. ... Qh4 $5 31. dxe7 $5 fxe3 32. exf8=N+ Rxf8 33. Qxe3 Rf3 34. Be6 $5 
Rxe3 35. fxe3 Qf6 36. Bd5 Qxb2 37. Rdd4 Qb5 38. Rdc4 Bxa5 39. Bxb7 $1 Be1 
40. Bxe4 Bxe4 41. Rxe4 Qe2 $5 42. Rf4 a5 43. Rac4 $2 {Mickey  makes the 
last mistake.} 
    ( 43. Rad4 Qc2 44. Rc4 Bf2+ 45. Kg2 Qe2 46. Ng3 Bxg3+ 47. Kxg3 Qxe3+ {
    draws (Kozul).} )
43. ... Bf2+ $5 44. Rxf2 Qxc4 45. Nd2 Qxc5 46. Re2 a4 47. Kf2 a3 48. Nb1 
Qf8+ 49. Kg1 Qf3 {The match between England and Yugoslavia ended in 2-2. 
England and  the USA shared  the second place.} 0-1

