1. b3 e5 2. Bb2 Nc6 3. e3 Nf6 4. c4 Be7 5. Nc3 O-O 6. Nf3 Re8 7. Nd5 $5 
Bf8 8. Be2 d6 9. O-O Nxd5 10. cxd5 Ne7 11. e4 Ng6 12. Bb5 Bd7 13. Bxd7 
Qxd7 14. Rc1 c6 15. dxc6 bxc6 16. g3 d5 17. exd5 cxd5 18. d3 f6 19. Qe2 a5
20. a4 Rab8 21. Nd2 Bb4 22. Bc3 Bxc3 23. Rxc3 Nf8 24. Rfc1 Ne6 25. Qd1 
Rec8 26. Rxc8+ Rxc8 27. Nf3 Qb7 28. Rxc8+ Qxc8 29. d4 e4 30. Nh4 g6 31. 
Ng2 Ng5 32. Nf4 Nf3+ 33. Kg2 Qc6 34. Ne2 Kf7 35. h4 g5 36. h5 Qc2 37. Qxc2
Ne1+ 38. Kh3 Nxc2 {Black has a better knight ending.} 39. g4 Ke6 40. f4 $2
gxf4 $2 
    ( 40. ... exf3 {wins at once.} )
41. Nxf4+ Kd6 {The chances are almost  equal.} 42. Ne2 Ne1 43. Kg3 Nd3 44.
 Kg2 Nb4 45. Kg3 Nc6 46. Kf4 Ke6 47. Ke3 Kf7 48. Ng3 Ne7 49. Kf4 Nc6 50. 
Ke3 Nb4 51. Kd2 Nd3 52. Nf5 Ke6 53. Ng7+ Kd7 54. Nf5 Nf2 55. Ne3 Kc6 56. 
Ke2 Nd3 57. Kd2 Nf4 58. Nf5 Kd7 59. Ne3 Ke6 60. Nc2 Nd3 61. Ne3 Nf4 62. 
Kd1 Nd3 63. Kd2 Nb4 64. Nf5 Nc6 65. Ke3 Nd8 66. Kd2 Nf7 67. Ke3 Kd7 68. 
Kd2 Nd6 69. Ne3 Ke6 70. Ng2 $1 Nc8 71. Kc3 Na7 72. b4 $1 {White takes the 
initiative.} 72. ... axb4+ 73. Kxb4 Kd6 74. Nf4 Nc6+ 75. Kc3 Na5 76. Kd2 
Nc6 77. Ke3 Nb4 78. Ne2 Nc6 79. Kf4 Ke6 80. h6 Kf7 $5 81. Ke3 $1 Ke6 $6 
    ( 81. ... Nb4 {Better is} 82. a5 Kg6 )
82. Nf4+ Kd6 83. Ng6 $1 Nb4 84. Kd2 $5 Nc6 85. Ke3 Nb4 86. Nf8 $1 Nc2+ 87.
 Kf4 $2 Nxd4 $2 
    ( 87. ... e3 $1 88. Kf3 f5 89. gxf5 Nxd4+ 90. Kxe3 Nxf5+ 91. Kf4 Nxh6 
    {draws.} )
88. a5 $1 Ke7 89. Nxh7 Ne6+ 90. Ke3 Nc5 $2 
    ( 90. ... Nc7 $1 91. Ng5 $5 Kf8 92. Nh3 Kf7 $1 {escapes.} )
91. Ng5 $1 {White wins elegantly.} 91. ... Kf8 92. Kd4 Na6 93. Ne6+ Kg8 
94. Kxd5 Nc7+ $5 
    ( 94. ... e3 {Or} 95. Nf4 Kh7 96. Ke6 {and White wins.} )
95. Kxe4 Nxe6 96. Kf5 Nc5 97. Kxf6 {White has  three pawns for a knight.} 
97. ... Nd7+ 98. Kf5 Kh7 99. g5 Nc5 100. Kf6 Nd7+ 101. Ke6 {Adams had won 
the  endless fight.} 1-0

