1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 a6 4. Ba4 Nf6 5. O-O Be7 6. Re1 b5 7. Bb3 d6 8.
 c3 O-O 9. d3 Na5 10. Bc2 c5 11. Nbd2 Re8 12. Nf1 h6 13. Ng3 Bf8 14. d4 
Bd7 $5 
    ( 14. ... Qc7 {Usual is (Teichmann - Tarrasch, Oostende 1905).} )
15. d5 Nc4 16. a4 bxa4 $2 
    ( 16. ... Nb6 $1 {Adams advices} )
17. Bxa4 {White grabs the  initiative on the queenside.} 17. ... Nb6 18. 
Bxd7 Qxd7 19. Nd2 g6 20. Ra5 $5 Qc7 21. Ra2 Reb8 22. Ngf1 Nfd7 23. Ne3 a5 
$6 
    ( 23. ... c4 $1 {(Adams)} 24. Qe2 Rc8 {offers more resistance.} )
24. c4 h5 25. Nb1 Rb7 26. Nc3 Qb8 27. Bd2 Bh6 28. Qe2 Nc8 29. Rea1 Bxe3 
30. Bxe3 Rb4 $5 31. Nd1 Ncb6 32. Bd2 a4 $1 
    ( 32. ... Rxc4 $5 {The alternative is} 33. b3 Rd4 34. Bc3 Nc8 )
33. Ne3 $5 
    ( 33. Bxb4 $1 cxb4 {(Adams)} 34. Qe1 $1 b3 35. Ra3 {also leads to a 
    white advantage.} )
33. ... Rb3 34. Qd1 Qb7 35. Bc3 Rb8 36. Qc2 Qc8 37. h3 Nf6 38. Nf1 Nxc4 $1
39. Rxa4 Nxb2 40. Ra6 Nc4 
    ( 40. ... Nxe4 $5 41. Bxb2 Nxf2 42. Bxe5 $1 dxe5 43. Qxf2 {wins  for 
    White.} )
41. Be1 $1 Nb2 42. Rxd6 {Adams has gained a second pawn.} 42. ... Ne8 43. 
Rc6 Qb7 44. Nd2 Rb5 45. Rxc5 Rxc5 46. Qxc5 Nd3 47. Qc3 Qb2 48. Qxb2 Rxb2 
49. Nc4 Rc2 50. Ne3 Rc8 51. Bd2 Nd6 52. f3 f5 53. exf5 gxf5 54. Ra3 Nb2 
55. Ra6 Nbc4 56. Nxc4 Nxc4 57. Bg5 Rb8 58. Rc6 Rb1+ 59. Kh2 Nb6 60. d6 Kf7
61. Rxb6 $1 {The Dutchmen were defeated by 31/2-1/2. England led by 
half-a-point on Russia and Bosnia.} 1-0

