8. Bd3 h6 9. Bh4 Nh5 10. Bxe7 Qxe7 11. Nge2 Nb6 12. O-O O-O 13. Rab1 a5 $5
{Adams  prevents a minority attack by b4.} 14. Qb3 Qd8 $5 15. Na4 Nxa4 16.
 Qxa4 Bg4 17. Nc3 Re8 18. Qc2 Qg5 19. Kh1 Nf6 20. a3 Qh5 21. b4 {Leko has 
carried out his plan.} 21. ... axb4 22. axb4 Bf3 $5 23. gxf3 
    ( 23. Bf5 $6 Ra3 $1 {favours Black.} )
23. ... Qxf3+ 24. Kg1 Qg4+ 25. Kh1 Qf3+ 26. Kg1 Qg4+ 27. Kh1 Qf3+ {It ends
as a draw by perpetual check.} 1/2-1/2

