1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nc3 a6 6. Be3 e5 7. Nf3 Qc7 
8. a4 Be6 9. Be2 h6 10. O-O Nbd7 11. h3 Be7 12. Nh2 O-O 13. Ng4 $5 Qc6 14.
 Qd3 Rfc8 15. Rfd1 Rab8 16. a5 Nc5 $2 
    ( 16. ... Nh7 {Correct is} )
17. Nxf6+ $1 Bxf6 
    ( 17. ... gxf6 18. Bxc5 Qxc5 19. Bg4 {leads to a positional disaster  
    for Black.} )
18. Qxd6 Qxd6 19. Rxd6 {White has gained a pawn.} 19. ... Be7 20. Rd2 Bg5 
21. Bxg5 hxg5 22. Bg4 b5 $5 23. axb6 Rxb6 24. Nd5 $1 Rb7 25. f3 Rcb8 $5 
26. b4 $1 {Svidler lost the fourth game by a poor treatment of the 
opening. So Adams  qualified.} 1-0

